@isiddeeq-cisco Approved for the 202605 branch cherry-pick request with an explicit release-review exception: target-branch test-evidence requirements are waived for this change. This does not claim a bug was filed or tests were run. A saved local source code-review confirmation is optional; no human review is claimed. GitHub review blockers and other workflow checks remain required. This approves the release label only; it does not merge or approve the original PR. Original-source CI is not required because the original PR is already merged; target/backport CI policy is unchanged.

Exception reason: Approve for cherrypick.

